# Elice SKincare

A vibrant, mobile-first skincare storefront built with Vite, Vanilla JavaScript, HTML, and CSS.

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Then open the Vite preview URL. The project uses a multi-page setup with entries at `/`, `/src/pages/collection.html`, `/src/pages/product.html`, `/src/pages/about.html`, and `/src/pages/contact.html`.

## Structure

- `public/data/products.json` — catalog source data.
- `src/app/` — page bootstrapping, product loading, filtering, cart state, and notifications.
- `src/components/` — reusable product card/grid and shared rendering helpers.
- `src/partials/` — reusable header, navigation, footer, and cart partial placeholders.
- `src/styles/` — modular CSS files imported by the app entrypoint.
